        <div class="mt-10 rounded-card bg-white p-6">
          <p class="label text-ink-muted">Three Ways to Participate</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-small"><strong>Angels &amp; early investors</strong> — Wire or SAFE commitment, minimum $25K</p>
